WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.950
- Well, we have an audience full of people

00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:04.860
who have been inspired by Olivia
to take some gutsy chances.

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:07.830
But before we hear them, I
feel like we should share ours.

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:09.900
I'll share, I was kind
of sharing a little bit

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:11.490
of mine in the break,

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:15.720
but I get tattoos, well, not all of them,

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:18.210
but a lot of them are when
not great things happen.

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:22.615
And I do it because I like
the reminder that I made it.

00:00:22.615 --> 00:00:25.230
And it, sometimes things seem so big

00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:27.630
in your world at that moment

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:30.300
and you feel like you're not
gonna make it, and then you do.

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:32.550
And so, usually that's
when I get the tattoo.

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:35.987
One of my favorites is on
my middle finger. (laughs)

00:00:35.987 --> 00:00:36.820
(Olivia laughs)

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:37.653
Yeah.

00:00:37.653 --> 00:00:39.390
And it says DC and it's,
'cause somebody made me feel,

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:41.310
and I don't know, I hope
you never experience this

00:00:41.310 --> 00:00:43.920
or haven't, but, 'cause I do
think we've progressed a little

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:47.610
in this industry, but yeah,
people can be very mean.

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:50.100
I mean, they can be just vicious

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:52.080
and it's, you know, if
you're not successful,

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:53.670
how they want you to be
and doing what you want.

00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:55.650
And it's usually their shortcomings.

00:00:55.650 --> 00:00:56.483
- [Olivia] Sure.

00:00:56.483 --> 00:00:57.990
- And I mean, just someone was so vicious

00:00:57.990 --> 00:01:00.780
and I was so tired of sitting in a room

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:02.430
where men just made me feel like (beep)

00:01:02.430 --> 00:01:04.560
and then I was like, you know what, nope.

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:08.310
I actually had the guts to finally say,

00:01:08.310 --> 00:01:09.600
and I was in my twenties, you know,

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:11.670
and I started at 19, so
I was, it took a minute,

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:14.430
but I finally said like, you know what?

00:01:14.430 --> 00:01:16.500
I was like, "Actually, I
think this is about you

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:17.370
and I think this is about,"

00:01:17.370 --> 00:01:19.170
and I just totally said everything

00:01:19.170 --> 00:01:20.700
I've ever wanted to say in that moment.

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:22.200
So that's one of my favorite tattoos.

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:24.272
- Wow, that's beautiful.

00:01:24.272 --> 00:01:25.105
- Yeah.

00:01:25.105 --> 00:01:26.728
I hope you don't go through that, but,

00:01:26.728 --> 00:01:27.990
what's one of yours?

00:01:27.990 --> 00:01:28.823
- Oh my gosh.

00:01:28.823 --> 00:01:30.570
My gutsy story after that beautiful story,

00:01:30.570 --> 00:01:31.709
mine's gonna sound so silly.

00:01:31.709 --> 00:01:32.550
- [Kelly] No.
- I know.

00:01:32.550 --> 00:01:33.690
- No, it won't, make it lighter.

00:01:33.690 --> 00:01:34.523
- [Olivia] Okay, okay.

00:01:34.523 --> 00:01:35.370
- I was a little heavy for daytime.

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:36.637
(Olivia laughs)
Yeah, yeah.

00:01:36.637 --> 00:01:37.860
- For daytime.

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:39.928
You know, I was thinking, coming up here,

00:01:39.928 --> 00:01:42.000
because we're at 30
Rock, we're in New York.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:42.833
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:42.833 --> 00:01:45.240
- The second time I ever
performed in my career was on SNL.

00:01:45.240 --> 00:01:46.889
And I was 18 years old.

00:01:46.889 --> 00:01:48.385
(audience cheers)
- Wow.

00:01:48.385 --> 00:01:50.370
- And I was so, which is incredible,

00:01:50.370 --> 00:01:52.803
I mean, what an honor,
but I was terrified.

00:01:52.803 --> 00:01:54.090
- Yes, and it's so late.

00:01:54.090 --> 00:01:54.930
- [Olivia] It's so late.

00:01:54.930 --> 00:01:56.100
- Yes, for a vocalist.

00:01:56.100 --> 00:01:57.208
- Yes, and it's so live.

00:01:57.208 --> 00:01:58.285
- [Kelly] Uh huh.

00:01:58.285 --> 00:02:00.450
- Yeah, per the name.

00:02:00.450 --> 00:02:02.340
And I just remember being terrified

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:03.360
and being in my dressing room

00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:05.160
and being like, "I don't
know if I deserve to be here.

00:02:05.160 --> 00:02:06.150
This is terrifying."

00:02:06.150 --> 00:02:07.877
But did it anyway.

00:02:07.877 --> 00:02:08.760
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:02:08.760 --> 00:02:09.660
- That was brave of me.

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:11.100
But not quite as beautiful

00:02:11.100 --> 00:02:11.933
as your story.
- Whatever.

00:02:11.933 --> 00:02:12.766
Don't do that.

00:02:12.766 --> 00:02:13.599
That is very brave.

00:02:13.599 --> 00:02:14.432
I've done SNL.

00:02:14.432 --> 00:02:15.413
It's a little nerveracking.

00:02:15.413 --> 00:02:16.813
- It's scary, yeah.
- Yeah.

